    "message": "Release umf-weft 0.4.55 through qualified hosted wheel producers\n\nRename the Python distribution while preserving the qualified 0.4.54 compiler behavior and import/protocol identities. Add exact-source hosted ARM64 qualification, three-wheel promotion and the automatic PyPI producer handoff. Publisher, Graph, native table-operation and Truss facts checks passed; the broader compiler conformance job continues separately. Actual release platform qualification and public registry gates follow this source freeze.",
